# Multi-Sniper proxy list
#
# Copy this file to proxies.txt and paste your proxies in, one per line.
# It is loaded automatically at startup - no environment variable needed -
# and proxies.txt is gitignored, so your credentials never get committed.
#
# Any of these formats work; they are all normalised for you:
#
#   1.2.3.4:8080                      bare host:port
#   1.2.3.4:8080:user:pass            host:port:user:pass  (most vendors)
#   user:pass@1.2.3.4:8080            credentials, no scheme
#   user:pass:1.2.3.4:8080            credentials first
#   http://user:pass@1.2.3.4:8080     already a URL
#   https://1.2.3.4:3128              HTTPS proxy endpoint
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored. Duplicates are dropped.
# SOCKS proxies are NOT supported and will stop the bot at startup with a
# clear message rather than silently exposing your real IP.
#
# Check your list any time with:   python proxies.py
#
# Distil a huge public list into 100 verified working proxies:
#   python proxies.py "<list url>" --want 100 --skip-socks --keep proxies.txt

# gate.example-vendor.com:7000:myuser:mypassword
# gate.example-vendor.com:7001:myuser:mypassword
# 203.0.113.9:8080
